= Parties Resign

In response to our signing of the Treaty of Brest-Litovsk, our coalition partners have announced that they are resigning from government in protest. The other parties vigorously protest the treaty, with the <span style="color: var(--lsr-color); font-weight: bold;">Left-SRs</span> in particular emerging at the forefront of the protests. 

- @so_be_it

@so_be_it
